<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1619] HighDFWordsPruner overwrites cache files</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1619</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;HighDFWordsPruner uses DistributedCache.setCacheFiles which will overwrite any files already in the cache.  Per the fix in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1498&quot; title=&quot;DistributedCache.setCacheFiles in DictionaryVectorizer overwrites jars pushed using oozie&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-1498&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-1498&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; we should be using addCacheFile, which will not overwrite existing cache files.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12746432">MAHOUT-1619</key>
            <summary>HighDFWordsPruner overwrites cache files</summary>
